    "plain": "The policy keeps existing skills and jobs funding running for three more years, which is helpful \u2014 but then redirects that money to a National Service scheme that is less targeted at low-income areas and whose effect on workers' pay and job quality is highly uncertain.",
    "biggest_unknown": "Whether the National Service scheme would deliver meaningful, lasting skills and employment gains for ordinary workers, or prove as ineffective as comparable past schemes like the National Citizen Service.",
